                "description": "The Adelaide Mortise Handleset features a thin profile of just 1-3/4 inches, making it a great choice for narrow stile applications. Choose from dummy and single cylinder functions. This Modern Adelaide Mortise Entrance Handleset has an ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body, which can be toggled to lock automatically upon closing the door. The Contemporary Adelaide Entrance Handleset will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Choose from a huge selection of interior knobs and levers in a wide selection of the most modern finishes for a look that is all you.\r\n",
